# M4.29.2 full unittest discovery root

Date: 2026-08-28

## Symptom

`python3 -m unittest discover -v` exited successfully but discovered zero tests.

## Cause

This repository's test modules are discovered only when the `tests` directory
is supplied explicitly as the discovery start directory.

## Impact

No source, server or service state was changed by the empty test invocation.
It is not accepted as validation evidence.

## Resolution

Run the complete suite with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v` and use
only that non-zero result as full-suite evidence.
